  "ruleText": "Liq 304.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish and maintain a system for listing of wine for sale in state liquor stores.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Liq 300) #14018, eff 7-3-24",
